d:You are the on-call analyst at VNCD-CERT, Veltronia's national CERT. GridLink Dispatch, run by Harnvik Grid Operator, authorizes load-shedding orders for a regional grid. During a hostile campaign against Veltronian infrastructure, it began emitting unusual telemetry after a routine deployment, yet engineers report no unauthorized changes.

<br>

Determine what changed and recover the order-signing key from the preserved investigation bundle. This is a constructed offline case; analyse the supplied files only and do not contact any services named in the evidence.

